@ApiUrl = https://localhost:7180
@ApiKey = replace-in-non-development

### List the available jobs
GET {{ApiUrl}}/api/jobs
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Simulate sending a report (logs only; no email)
POST {{ApiUrl}}/api/jobs/send-report
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Schedule the simulated report
POST {{ApiUrl}}/api/jobs/send-report/delayed?minutes=1
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Readiness checks SQL storage and an active Worker heartbeat
GET {{ApiUrl}}/health/ready

### Enqueue with a caller-supplied idempotency key
POST {{ApiUrl}}/api/jobs/import-commandes?batchId=2a7bb48e-2f81-4bfe-acd3-e084c94588d3
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Delayed execution
POST {{ApiUrl}}/api/jobs/import-commandes/delayed?minutes=5
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Trigger the registered recurring job
POST {{ApiUrl}}/api/jobs/import-commandes/trigger-recurring
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
